<Layout title="Cursed Gem Windows Privacy Policy" description="How Cursed Gem Windows handles local game progress, customization, Google Play purchases, backup, and deletion.">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy / Cursed Gem Windows</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy — <em>Cursed Gem Windows</em></h1>
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> November 8, 2026<br /><strong>Developer:</strong> Velvet &amp; Pixel<br /><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com">velvetandpixel@gmail.com</a></p>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>Cursed Gem Windows is a stained-glass puzzle game for Android. Gameplay, saved progress, collected windows, and equipped cosmetic preferences are handled on your device. No Velvet &amp; Pixel account is required. We do not operate a game-progress server or receive your puzzle moves, collected windows, or equipped looks through the app.</p>
    <h2>Local game data</h2>
    <p>The app stores chapel and mode progress, window rewards, tutorial completion, selected chapel, and customization preferences in its private local storage. This lets you continue playing across launches. Core puzzles and previously verified unlocks can work offline. The app does not provide its own cloud save, cross-device synchronization, or a transfer of browser-playtest progress into the Android app.</p>
    <h2>Google Play purchases</h2>
    <p>Optional chapel and cosmetic unlocks use Google Play Billing. Google processes payments with your Google Play account. We do not receive or store your payment card details. Purchases are permanent one-time unlocks rather than subscriptions.</p>
    <p>The app receives purchase information, including product identifiers, purchase tokens, signed purchase records, and purchase state, to verify ownership, grant access, acknowledge completed purchases, and recover earlier purchases. Signed purchase records are verified locally and retained in application-private storage excluded from Android backup. Velvet &amp; Pixel does not currently operate a purchase-verification server for this game.</p>
    <p>Prices, checkout, purchase recovery, and online ownership checks communicate with Google Play. Previously verified ownership is cached for offline access. A successful online ownership refresh can remove refunded or revoked unlocks. Pending payments do not grant access. Removing local app data does not cancel or erase a completed Google Play purchase; eligible purchases can be recovered with the purchasing Google account. Purchase recovery restores eligible unlocks, not puzzle progress or collected-window progress.</p>
    <h2>Google SDK technical information</h2>
    <p>The app includes Google Play Billing and its supporting libraries. Google may process transaction information and operational or diagnostic data needed to provide these services. This can include the app package and version, SDK and Android versions, device information, country or language settings, network information, billing-operation results, errors, and temporary session identifiers.</p>
    <p>Google services can be contacted when the app starts or resumes and when it checks billing availability, prices, or ownership, as well as during checkout and purchase recovery. This processing is not limited to people who complete a purchase. We do not send your puzzle moves, collected windows, or customization preferences to Google Play Billing. Google determines retention and handling of information on its services under its own policies; uninstalling the app does not delete Google-held payment or technical records.</p>
    <ul><li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="https://play.google.com/about/play-terms/">Google Play Terms of Service</a></li><li><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/retention">Google data retention information</a></li><li><a href="https://myaccount.google.com/data-and-privacy">Google Account data and privacy controls</a></li></ul>
    <h2>Advertising, analytics, and permissions</h2>
    <p>The app does not include developer-operated advertising, analytics, or crash-reporting services. It has no ads or subscriptions. Google SDK operational processing is described above. The game does not request access to your photos, contacts, microphone, or precise location. Internet access supports Google Play services and opening external links such as this policy.</p>
    <h2>Android backup, retention, and deletion</h2>
    <p>Game progress and settings are kept while the app is installed or until its local storage is cleared. Android backup is enabled for ordinary app data, so Android may back up or transfer eligible progress and preferences according to your device, Google account, and backup settings. Recovery is controlled by Android and is not guaranteed by this app. Verified purchase receipts are stored separately in Android's no-backup directory and are not included in that backup.</p>
    <p>Clearing app storage in Android Settings or uninstalling removes the app's local data, including progress and local purchase records. An Android backup may remain separately and may restore eligible ordinary app data after reinstalling. Manage or delete those backups through your device and Google backup settings. Google Play purchase history and other Google-held information are governed by Google's policies and account controls. The app has no Velvet &amp; Pixel account or developer-hosted game save to delete.</p>
    <h2>Support and external links</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we receive your email address and the information you choose to include. We use that correspondence to answer and resolve your request. Include the app version and a description of the issue; do not send payment card details or passwords. We retain support correspondence while needed to handle the request or meet applicable obligations. Contact us to ask about deletion of correspondence we hold.</p>
    <p>Opening this policy, a support link, or another external service is subject to that service's privacy practices. This policy is hosted on GitHub Pages; visiting it involves normal website requests to that hosting provider. The app does not require you to open external sites to play its core puzzles.</p>
    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>We do not knowingly solicit personal information from children through the game. If you believe a child has provided personal information directly to Velvet &amp; Pixel, contact us so we can address it. Google Play account and purchase services operate under Google's policies and parental controls.</p>
    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>The app uses Android's private app storage and verifies signed purchase records. The game does not add a separate encryption layer to its local game or purchase-record files; digital signatures verify authenticity rather than encrypting contents. No software can guarantee absolute security.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy when functionality, integrations, or legal requirements change. The effective date appears above. For privacy questions or requests, contact <a href="mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com">velvetandpixel@gmail.com</a>.</p>
